// 由 tools/build-desc.js 產生，不要手改。[標題西, 標題英, 標題英(簡), 說明繁, 說明簡, 說明西, 說明英]
window.GDESC=Object.assign(window.GDESC||{},{"1-1-0":["Preguntas con 嗎","Ways to Ask Questions in Chinese / Asking Questions with 嗎 ma","Ways to Ask Questions in Chinese / Asking Questions with 吗 ma","問是不是、有沒有的問題時，在句子最後加「嗎」。也可以用「A 不 A」的方式問，例如「是不是」。","问是不是、有没有的问题时，在句子最后加「吗」。也可以用「A 不 A」的方式问，例如「是不是」。","Para preguntas de sí/no: añade 嗎 al final de una oración afirmativa. También puedes usar la forma A-no-A (verbo + 不 + verbo).","For yes/no questions, add 嗎 at the end of a statement. You can also use the A-not-A pattern (verb + 不 + verb)."],"1-1-1":["Cómo responder: 是 / 不是","Answering Questions in Chinese / Affirmative Answers / Negative Replies with 不 bù","","回答時重複問句裡的動詞，例如「是」或「不是」。「不」放在動詞或形容詞前面，不要只回答 yes 或 no。","回答时重复问句里的动词，例如「是」或「不是」。「不」放在动词或形容词前面，不要只回答 yes 或 no。","Se responde repitiendo el verbo: 是 / 不是. La negación 不 va justo antes del verbo o adjetivo. No se contesta con un simple «sí/no».","Answer by repeating the verb: 是 / 不是. 不 goes right before the verb or adjective. Don't answer with a bare 'yes' or 'no'."],"1-1-2":["Adjetivos con 很","Modification Marker 很 hěn","","形容詞當謂語時，前面通常要加「很」。這裡的「很」不一定是「非常」的意思，沒有它句子會像在做比較。","形容词当谓语时，前面通常要加「很」。这里的「很」不一定是「非常」的意思，没有它句子会像在做比较。","Con adjetivos (verbos estativos) se pone 很 antes del adjetivo. Aquí 很 casi no significa «muy»; sin él, la oración suena a comparación.","When an adjective is the predicate, put 很 before it. Here 很 usually doesn't mean 'very'; without it the sentence sounds like a comparison."],"1-1-3":["¿Y tú? con 呢","Contrastive Questions with 呢 ne","","「呢」可以把同樣的問題丟給對方，意思是「那你呢？」「那……呢？」。","「呢」可以把同样的问题丢给对方，意思是「那你呢？」「那……呢？」。","呢 devuelve la misma pregunta al otro: «¿y tú?», «¿y …?».","呢 turns the same question back to the other person: 'And you?', 'What about …?'."],"1-2-0":["Posesión con 的","的 de possessive","","「名詞或代名詞＋的＋名詞」表示誰的東西。家人或很親近的人，常常可以省略「的」。","「名词或代名词＋的＋名词」表示谁的东西。家人或很亲近的人，常常可以省略「的」。","Sustantivo/pronombre + 的 + sustantivo expresa posesión. Con familiares o personas muy cercanas se suele omitir 的.","Noun/pronoun + 的 + noun shows possession. With family or very close people, 的 is often left out."],"1-2-1":["Modificador + 的","Modifier Marker 的 de","","「的」連接修飾語（形容詞或一段話）和它說明的名詞。修飾語一定放在名詞前面。","「的」连接修饰语（形容词或一段话）和它说明的名词。修饰语一定放在名词前面。","的 une un modificador (adjetivo o frase) con el sustantivo que describe. El modificador siempre va delante del sustantivo.","的 links a modifier (an adjective or a phrase) to the noun it describes. The modifier always comes before the noun."],"1-2-2":["Tener con 有","有 yǒu possessive","","「有」是「擁有」的意思。否定要說「沒有」，不能說「不有」。","「有」是「拥有」的意思。否定要说「没有」，不能说「不有」。","有 = tener. Su negación es 沒有 (nunca 不有).","有 means 'to have'. Its negation is 沒有 (never 不有)."],"1-2-3":["Todos con 都","都 dōu totality","","「都」是「全部」「都是」的意思。放在動詞前面，指的是它前面提到的人或事。","「都」是「全部」「都是」的意思。放在动词前面，指的是它前面提到的人或事。","都 = todos / ambos. Va antes del verbo y se refiere a lo que aparece antes de él.","都 means 'all' or 'both'. It goes before the verb and refers to what comes before it."],"1-2-4":["Clasificadores 個 y 張","Measures 個 ge and 張 zhāng","Measures 个 ge and 张 zhāng","句型是「數字＋量詞＋名詞」。「個」最常用；「張」用在平平的東西，例如紙、桌子、票、照片。","句型是「数字＋量词＋名词」。「个」最常用；「张」用在平平的东西，例如纸、桌子、票、照片。","Estructura: número + clasificador + sustantivo. 個 es el clasificador más general; 張 se usa para cosas planas (papel, mesa, boleto, foto).","Pattern: number + measure word + noun. 個 is the most general measure word; 張 is for flat things (paper, tables, tickets, photos)."],"1-3-0":["Palabras de tiempo","Placement of Time Words","","時間詞放在動詞前面（主詞後面或句首），不放在句尾。","时间词放在动词前面（主词后面或句首），不放在句尾。","Las palabras de tiempo van antes del verbo (después del sujeto o al inicio de la oración), nunca al final.","Time words go before the verb (after the subject or at the start of the sentence), never at the end."],"1-3-1":["Ir a hacer algo con 去","To Go Do Something with 去 qù","","「去＋地方＋動詞」表示到某個地方做某件事。","「去＋地方＋动词」表示到某个地方做某件事。","去 + lugar + verbo: ir a un lugar para hacer algo.","去 + place + verb means going somewhere to do something."],"1-3-2":["Oraciones con tema","Topic Sentences","","可以先說出大家已經知道的話題，再說明它。這時受詞會移到句子前面。","可以先说出大家已经知道的话题，再说明它。这时受词会移到句子前面。","Se puede poner primero el tema (algo ya conocido) y luego comentarlo. El objeto pasa al inicio de la oración.","You can start with the topic (something already known) and then comment on it. The object moves to the front of the sentence."],"1-3-3":["Orden de 也, 都, 常","The Word Order of Adverbs 也 yě,都 dōu and 常 cháng","","「也」「都」「常」放在主詞後面、動詞前面。「也」和「都」一起用時，「也」在前面。","「也」「都」「常」放在主词后面、动词前面。「也」和「都」一起用时，「也」在前面。","Los adverbios 也, 都 y 常 van después del sujeto y antes del verbo. Si aparecen 也 y 都 juntos, 也 va primero.","The adverbs 也, 都 and 常 go after the subject and before the verb. When 也 and 都 appear together, 也 comes first."],"1-3-4":["Sugerencias con 吧","Making Suggestions 吧 ba","","句尾加「吧」，語氣比較輕，是在提議或邀請：「我們……吧」。","句尾加「吧」，语气比较轻，是在提议或邀请：「我们……吧」。","吧 al final de la oración hace una sugerencia o invitación suave: «vamos a…», «¿qué tal si…?».","Adding 吧 at the end makes a gentle suggestion or invitation: 'let's …', 'how about …?'."],"1-4-0":["Clasificadores 塊, 杯, 支, 種","Measures 塊 kuài, 杯 bēi,支 zhī and 種 zhǒng","Measures 块 kuài, 杯 bēi,支 zhī and 种 zhǒng","「塊」用在錢；「杯」用在杯子裝的飲料；「支」用在細長的東西（筆）；「種」是「種類」。","「块」用在钱；「杯」用在杯子装的饮料；「支」用在细长的东西（笔）；「种」是「种类」。","塊 para dinero; 杯 para bebidas en vaso o taza; 支 para objetos largos y delgados (lápiz, bolígrafo); 種 = tipo, clase.","塊 is for money; 杯 for drinks in a cup or glass; 支 for long, thin objects (pens, pencils); 種 means 'kind, type'."],"1-4-1":["Hacer algo por alguien: 幫","Preposition 幫 bāng on behalf of","Preposition 帮 bāng on behalf of","「幫＋人＋動詞」表示替某人做某件事。","「帮＋人＋动词」表示替某人做某件事。","幫 + persona + verbo = hacer algo por alguien / en su lugar.","幫 + person + verb means doing something for someone."],"1-4-2":["Omitir el sustantivo: …的","的 De-phrase with the Head Noun Omitted","","已經知道在說什麼東西時，可以把名詞省略，只留下「修飾語＋的」，意思是「……的那個」。","已经知道在说什么东西时，可以把名词省略，只留下「修饰语＋的」，意思是「……的那个」。","Cuando ya se sabe de qué sustantivo se habla, se omite y queda «modificador + 的»: «el/la/los de…».","When it's clear what noun is meant, you can drop it and keep 'modifier + 的': 'the one that is …'."],"1-4-3":["Demasiado: 太…了","太…了 tài…le overly","","「太＋形容詞＋了」是「太……了」，有時只是感嘆，意思是「真是……啊」。","「太＋形容词＋了」是「太……了」，有时只是感叹，意思是「真是……啊」。","太 + adjetivo + 了 = demasiado… (a veces solo exclamación: «¡qué… !»).","太 + adjective + 了 means 'too …' (sometimes just an exclamation: 'so …!')."],"1-4-4":["Poder con 能","能 néng capability","","「能」表示有能力或有可能做某件事。否定是「不能」。","「能」表示有能力或有可能做某件事。否定是「不能」。","能 expresa capacidad o posibilidad: «puedo», «es posible». Negación: 不能.","能 expresses ability or possibility ('can'). The negative is 不能."],"1-4-5":["Y pico: 多","多 duō …and more","","數字後面加「多」，意思是「超過」。也用在問程度的問句：多大、多高、多久。","数字后面加「多」，意思是「超过」。也用在问程度的问句：多大、多高、多久。","Después de un número, 多 significa «y pico, más de». También se usa en preguntas de grado: 多大, 多高, 多久.","After a number, 多 means 'more than'. It is also used in degree questions: 多大, 多高, 多久."],"1-5-0":["Un poco: 有一點","有一點 yǒu yìdiǎn slightly","有一点 yǒu yìdiǎn slightly","「有一點＋形容詞」是「有點……」，通常表示不太滿意的感覺。","「有一点＋形容词」是「有点……」，通常表示不太满意的感觉。","有一點 + adjetivo = un poco, algo. Suele expresar algo que no es del todo agradable.","有一點 + adjective means 'a little, somewhat', usually about something not quite pleasant."],"1-5-1":["Verbo + 得 + adjetivo","Complement Marker 得 de","","「動詞＋得＋形容詞」說明動作做得怎麼樣。如果有受詞，要先重複一次動詞。","「动词＋得＋形容词」说明动作做得怎么样。如果有受词，要先重复一次动词。","Verbo + 得 + adjetivo describe cómo se hace la acción. Si hay objeto, se repite el verbo.","Verb + 得 + adjective describes how an action is done. If there is an object, the verb is repeated."],"1-5-2":["Saber hacer: 會","Acquired Skills 會 huì","Acquired Skills 会 huì","「會」表示學過、懂得怎麼做。否定是「不會」。","「会」表示学过、懂得怎么做。否定是「不会」。","會 = saber hacer algo (habilidad aprendida). Negación: 不會.","會 means knowing how to do something (a learned skill). The negative is 不會."],"1-5-3":["Destino con 到","Destination Marker 到 dào","","「移動動詞＋到＋地方」表示去到、走到某個地方，「到」標示目的地。","「移动动词＋到＋地方」表示去到、走到某个地方，「到」标示目的地。","Verbo de movimiento + 到 + lugar: llegar hasta / ir hasta. 到 marca el destino.","Movement verb + 到 + place means reaching or going as far as a place; 到 marks the destination."],"1-6-0":["Ubicación con 在","Locative Marker 在 zài","","「主詞＋在＋地方」說明某人或某物在哪裡（說的是已經知道的人或東西）。","「主词＋在＋地方」说明某人或某物在哪里（说的是已经知道的人或东西）。","Sujeto + 在 + lugar indica dónde está algo o alguien (algo que ya se conoce).","Subject + 在 + place tells where someone or something is (something already known)."],"1-6-1":["Hay: lugar + 有","Existential Sentence with 有 yǒu","","「地方＋有＋東西／人」表示那裡有什麼。比較：「在」是已知的東西在哪裡；「有」是某個地方有什麼。","「地方＋有＋东西／人」表示那里有什么。比较：「在」是已知的东西在哪里；「有」是某个地方有什么。","Lugar + 有 + cosa/persona = en ese lugar hay algo. Contraste: 在 (algo conocido está en…) vs. 有 (en un lugar hay algo).","Place + 有 + thing/person means 'there is …' in that place. Contrast: 在 (a known thing is at …) vs. 有 (a place has …)."],"1-6-2":["Suavizar: V(一)V","Softened Action V（一）V","","動詞重複（V一V、VV）讓語氣變輕，意思是「稍微做一下」「試試看」，多用在短短的動作。","动词重复（V一V、VV）让语气变轻，意思是「稍微做一下」「试试看」，多用在短短的动作。","Repetir el verbo (V一V / VV) suaviza la acción: «un poquito», «probar». Se usa con acciones cortas.","Repeating the verb (V一V / VV) softens the action: 'a little', 'give it a try'. It is used with short actions."],"1-6-3":["Negar con 不是","不是 búshì Negation","","「不是」否定「是」，也用來更正：「不是 X，是 Y」。用來否定名詞。","「不是」否定「是」，也用来更正：「不是 X，是 Y」。用来否定名词。","不是 niega 是 y sirve para corregir: «no es X (sino Y)». Se usa para negar sustantivos.","不是 negates 是 and is used to correct: 'it's not X, it's Y'. It negates nouns."],"1-6-4":["Lugar de la actividad","Location of an Activity","","動作發生的地點用「在＋地方」，放在動詞前面。","动作发生的地点用「在＋地方」，放在动词前面。","El lugar donde ocurre la actividad va con 在 antes del verbo: 在 + lugar + verbo.","The place where an activity happens is marked with 在 + place, before the verb."],"1-7-0":["Tiempo y lugar","Time and Place of Events","","基本順序是：主詞＋時間＋地點＋動詞。","基本顺序是：主词＋时间＋地点＋动词。","Orden básico: sujeto + tiempo + lugar + verbo.","Basic order: subject + time + place + verb."],"1-7-1":["De A a B: 從…到…","從 cóng…到 dào… from A to B","从 cóng…到 dào… from A to B","「從 A 到 B」表示從 A 到 B，可以用在地點或時間。","「从 A 到 B」表示从 A 到 B，可以用在地点或时间。","從 A 到 B = de A a B (para lugares o tiempos).","從 A 到 B means 'from A to B', for places or times."],"1-7-2":["Acción en curso: 在","Progressive, On-going Actions 在 zài","","「(正)在＋動詞」表示動作正在進行。句尾可以加「呢」。","「(正)在＋动词」表示动作正在进行。句尾可以加「呢」。","(正)在 + verbo = estar haciendo algo (acción en curso). Puede terminar con 呢.","(正)在 + verb shows an action in progress ('be doing'). 呢 can be added at the end."],"1-7-3":["Cada: 每","每 měi each and every","","「每＋量詞／時間詞」是「每一……」。常常和「都」一起放在動詞前面。","「每＋量词／时间词」是「每一……」。常常和「都」一起放在动词前面。","每 + clasificador / palabra de tiempo = cada, todos los. Suele ir con 都 antes del verbo.","每 + measure word/time word means 'every, each'. It often goes with 都 before the verb."],"1-7-4":["Permiso con 可以","可以 kěyǐ permission","","「可以」表示可以做某事（許可）。問許可：「可以……嗎？」。不可以：「不可以」。","「可以」表示可以做某事（许可）。问许可：「可以……吗？」。不可以：「不可以」。","可以 = permiso: «se puede / puedo». Para pedir permiso: 可以…嗎？ Prohibición: 不可以.","可以 expresses permission ('may, can'). To ask for permission: 可以…嗎？ Prohibition: 不可以."],"1-8-0":["Compañía con 跟","Companionship with 跟 gēn","","「A 跟 B 一起＋動詞」表示和 B 一起做某件事。","「A 跟 B 一起＋动词」表示和 B 一起做某件事。","A 跟 B 一起 + verbo = hacer algo con B.","A 跟 B 一起 + verb means doing something together with B."],"1-8-1":["Cómo con 怎麼","Asking How with 怎麼 zěnme","Asking How with 怎么 zěnme","「怎麼＋動詞」問做某件事的方法或方式。","「怎么＋动词」问做某件事的方法或方式。","怎麼 + verbo pregunta por la manera o el método de hacer algo.","怎麼 + verb asks how to do something (the method)."],"1-8-2":["Comparación con 比較","Implicit Comparison with 比較 bǐjiào","Implicit Comparison with 比较 bǐjiào","「比較＋形容詞／動詞」是「比較……」，不用說出跟誰比，是隱含的比較。","「比较＋形容词／动词」是「比较……」，不用说出跟谁比，是隐含的比较。","比較 + adjetivo/verbo = «más» o «relativamente»; es una comparación implícita, sin decir con qué se compara.","比較 + adjective/verb means 'more …' or 'relatively …'. It is an implicit comparison; you don't say what it's compared to."],"1-8-3":["Ambas cualidades: 又…又…","又 yòu…又 yòu…… both A and B","","「又 A 又 B」表示同時有 A 和 B 兩個特點。","「又 A 又 B」表示同时有 A 和 B 两个特点。","又 A 又 B = a la vez A y B (dos cualidades juntas).","又 A 又 B means both A and B at the same time (two qualities together)."],"1-8-4":["Comparar con 比","Comparison with 比 bǐ","","「A 比 B＋形容詞」表示 A 比 B 更……。用「比」的時候不加「很」。要說差多少，可以加「一點」「多了」或數量。","「A 比 B＋形容词」表示 A 比 B 更……。用「比」的时候不加「很」。要说差多少，可以加「一点」「多了」或数量。","A 比 B + adjetivo = A es más… que B. Con 比 no se usa 很. Para indicar la diferencia: 一點 / 多了 / 三歲, etc.","A 比 B + adjective means A is more … than B. Don't use 很 with 比. To say how much the difference is, add 一點 / 多了 / an amount."],"1-9-0":["Momento vs. duración","Time-When vs. Time-Duration","","「什麼時候」（時間點）放在動詞前面；「多久」（時間長度）放在動詞後面。","「什么时候」（时间点）放在动词前面；「多久」（时间长度）放在动词后面。","El momento (cuándo) va antes del verbo; la duración (cuánto tiempo) va después del verbo.","When something happens (a point in time) goes before the verb; how long it lasts (duration) goes after the verb."],"1-9-1":["Duración de la acción","Time-Duration ‘for a period of time’","","「動詞＋時間長度（＋的＋受詞）」表示動作持續多久。","「动词＋时间长度（＋的＋受词）」表示动作持续多久。","Verbo + duración (+ 的 + objeto) indica cuánto tiempo dura la acción.","Verb + duration (+ 的 + object) tells how long the action lasts."],"1-9-2":["Cuando: …的時候","…的時候 de shíhòu when","…的时候 de shíhòu when","「一段話＋的時候」表示「當……的時候」，說明動作發生的那段時間。","「一段话＋的时候」表示「当……的时候」，说明动作发生的那段时间。","Frase + 的時候 = cuando… (en el momento en que ocurre algo).","Clause + 的時候 means 'when …' (at the time the action happens)."],"1-9-3":["A veces… a veces…","有時候 yǒu shíhòu…有時候 yǒu shíhòu… sometimes … sometimes …","有时候 yǒu shíhòu…有时候 yǒu shíhòu… sometimes … sometimes …","「有時候 A，有時候 B」表示有時候做 A，有時候做 B。","「有时候 A，有时候 B」表示有时候做 A，有时候做 B。","有時候 A，有時候 B = a veces A, a veces B.","有時候 A，有時候 B means 'sometimes A, sometimes B'."],"1-9-4":["Si…, entonces: 要是…就","Condition and Consequence with 要是 yaoshi…就 jiu…","","「要是＋條件，就＋結果」表示「如果……就……」。「就」放在動詞前面。","「要是＋条件，就＋结果」表示「如果……就……」。「就」放在动词前面。","要是 + condición，就 + resultado = si…, entonces…. 就 va antes del verbo.","要是 + condition, 就 + result means 'if …, then …'. 就 goes before the verb."],"1-10-0":["Probar: V V 看","V V 看 kàn to try and see","","「動詞重複＋看」表示試試看，看看會怎麼樣。","「动词重复＋看」表示试试看，看看会怎么样。","Verbo repetido + 看 = probar a hacer algo para ver qué tal.","Repeated verb + 看 means 'try doing it and see how it goes'."],"1-10-1":["Adjetivos duplicados","Intensification with Reduplicated State Verbs","","形容詞重疊（AA）會更生動，不再加「很」。兩個字的形容詞要重疊成 AABB。","形容词重叠（AA）会更生动，不再加「很」。两个字的形容词要重叠成 AABB。","Duplicar un adjetivo (AA) lo hace más vívido; ya no se le pone 很. Para adjetivos de dos sílabas se usa AABB.","Doubling an adjective (AA) makes it more vivid and no 很 is added. Two-syllable adjectives are doubled as AABB."],"1-10-2":["Oración como modificador","Clause as Modifiers of Nouns","","「一句話＋的＋名詞」，說明的話一定放在名詞前面（像關係子句）。","「一句话＋的＋名词」，说明的话一定放在名词前面（像关系子句）。","Una frase u oración + 的 + sustantivo: la descripción siempre va antes del sustantivo (como una cláusula de relativo).","Clause + 的 + noun: the description always comes before the noun (like a relative clause)."],"1-10-3":["Cambio con 了","Change in Situation with Sentential 了 le","","句尾的「了」表示情況改變、出現新的狀態：「已經……了」「現在……了」。","句尾的「了」表示情况改变、出现新的状态：「已经……了」「现在……了」。","了 al final de la oración indica un cambio de situación o un estado nuevo: «ya», «ahora ya».","了 at the end of a sentence shows a change of situation or a new state: 'now …', 'already …'."],"1-10-4":["Causa y efecto","Cause and Effect with 因為 yīnwèi，所以 suǒyǐ","Cause and Effect with 因为 yīnwèi，所以 suǒyǐ","「因為」說原因，「所以」說結果。中文常常兩個一起用。","「因为」说原因，「所以」说结果。中文常常两个一起用。","因為 introduce la causa y 所以 el resultado. En chino se suelen usar juntos.","因為 gives the reason and 所以 the result. In Chinese the two are often used together."],"1-11-0":["Venir a hacer: 來","To Come to Do Something with 來 lái","To Come to Do Something with 来 lái","「來＋動詞」表示來到說話的人所在的地方做某件事。","「来＋动词」表示来到说话的人所在的地方做某件事。","來 + verbo = venir a hacer algo (desde el punto de vista del lugar donde se habla).","來 + verb means coming (to where the speaker is) to do something."],"1-11-1":["Más pronto: 就","Sooner Than Expected with 就 jiù","","「時間＋就＋動詞」表示動作比預期更早或更快發生。","「时间＋就＋动词」表示动作比预期更早或更快发生。","Tiempo + 就 + verbo = la acción ocurre más temprano o más rápido de lo esperado.","Time + 就 + verb shows the action happens earlier or sooner than expected."],"1-11-2":["Hay alguien que…","Existential Subject with 有 yǒu","","句首用「有＋不確定的人或東西」，意思是「有人／有東西……」。","句首用「有＋不确定的人或东西」，意思是「有人／有东西……」。","有 + sujeto indefinido al inicio: «hay alguien/algo que…».","Starting a sentence with 有 + an indefinite subject means 'there is someone/something that …'."],"1-11-3":["Usos de 會","Different Types of 會 huì","Different Types of 会 huì","「會」除了「學會做某事」，也表示可能或將來：「應該會」「一定會」。","「会」除了「学会做某事」，也表示可能或将来：「应该会」「一定会」。","會 también expresa probabilidad o futuro: «seguramente», «va a». No solo significa «saber hacer».","Besides 'knowing how to', 會 also expresses probability or the future: 'will, is likely to'."],"1-11-4":["Omitir sustantivos","Omitting Nouns at 2nd mention","","已經提過的名詞，第二次說的時候可以省略。","已经提过的名词，第二次说的时候可以省略。","Cuando el sustantivo ya se mencionó, la segunda vez se puede omitir.","A noun that has already been mentioned can be omitted the second time."],"1-12-0":["Primero… luego: 先…再…","先 xiān…再 zài… first…, and then …","","「先 A，再 B」表示先做 A，然後做 B。","「先 A，再 B」表示先做 A，然后做 B。","先 A，再 B = primero A, luego B.","先 A，再 B means 'first A, then B'."],"1-12-1":["Enfatizar con 是…的","To Focus with 是 shì…的 de…","","「是……的」用來強調已經發生的動作的時間、地點、方式或一起去的人。","「是……的」用来强调已经发生的动作的时间、地点、方式或一起去的人。","是…的 destaca el cuándo, dónde, cómo o con quién de una acción que ya ocurrió.","是…的 emphasizes the time, place, manner or companion of an action that has already happened."],"1-12-2":["Después de: 以後","以後 yǐhòu after…","以后 yǐhòu after…","「時間／一段話＋以後」表示「在……之後」。單獨說「以後」是「未來」。","「时间／一段话＋以后」表示「在……之后」。单独说「以后」是「未来」。","Tiempo / frase + 以後 = después de…. Solo, 以後 significa «en el futuro».","Time/clause + 以後 means 'after …'. Used alone, 以後 means 'in the future'."],"1-12-3":["好 / 難 + verbo","Special Meanings of 好 hǎo/難 nán +Verbs","Special Meanings of 好 hǎo/难 nán +Verbs","「好＋動詞」表示容易、好用或令人愉快（好吃、好看、好用）；「難＋動詞」表示不容易或不好（難吃、難看、難用）。","「好＋动词」表示容易、好用或令人愉快（好吃、好看、好用）；「难＋动词」表示不容易或不好（难吃、难看、难用）。","好 + verbo = fácil / agradable de…: 好吃, 好看, 好用. 難 + verbo = difícil / desagradable de…: 難吃, 難看, 難用.","好 + verb means easy or pleasant to … (好吃, 好看, 好用); 難 + verb means hard or unpleasant to … (難吃, 難看, 難用)."],"1-13-0":["En cuanto: 一…就…","一 yī…就 jiù… …as soon as…","","「一 A 就 B」表示一做完 A，馬上就 B。","「一 A 就 B」表示一做完 A，马上就 B。","一 A 就 B = en cuanto A, B.","一 A 就 B means 'as soon as A, B'."],"1-13-1":["Acción completada: 了","Completed Action with Verbal 了 le","","「動詞＋了」表示動作已經完成，不等於過去式。後面通常有數量或其他補充說明。","「动词＋了」表示动作已经完成，不等于过去式。后面通常有数量或其他补充说明。","Verbo + 了 indica que la acción se completó (no equivale a «pasado»). Suele haber una cantidad o complemento después.","Verb + 了 shows the action is completed (it is not simply 'past tense'). It is usually followed by a quantity or other information."],"1-13-2":["不 vs. 沒","不 Negation vs.沒 Negation","不 Negation vs.没 Negation","「不」用在習慣、現在、未來和意願；「沒(有)」用在否定過去沒發生的事，也否定「有」。用「沒」的時候不加「了」。","「不」用在习惯、现在、未来和意愿；「没(有)」用在否定过去没发生的事，也否定「有」。用「没」的时候不加「了」。","不 niega hábitos, presente, futuro y voluntad. 沒(有) niega que una acción haya ocurrido, y niega 有. Con 沒 no se usa 了.","不 negates habits, the present, the future and will. 沒(有) negates that an action took place, and negates 有. Don't use 了 with 沒."],"1-13-3":["Pregunta + 都: cualquiera","All-inclusive with Question Words","","「疑問詞＋都／也」表示「任何……都」。否定用「誰都不」「什麼都沒」。","「疑问词＋都／也」表示「任何……都」。否定用「谁都不」「什么都没」。","Pregunta + 都 / 也: «cualquiera, todo, nadie…». Con negación: 誰都不 / 什麼都沒.","Question word + 都/也 means 'any, every, no one…'. Negative: 誰都不 / 什麼都沒."],"1-13-4":["Más / menos de lo planeado","More/less…Than Planned with 多 duō /少 shǎo＋ Verb…","","「多／少＋動詞＋數量」表示比原本計畫的更多／更少（動作已經發生）。","「多／少＋动词＋数量」表示比原本计划的更多／更少（动作已经发生）。","多 / 少 + verbo + cantidad = más / menos de lo planeado (acción ya realizada).","多/少 + verb + quantity means more/less than planned (the action has already happened)."],"1-13-5":["¿Verdad? con 是不是","是不是 shìbú shì is it true?","","「是不是」用來確認自己猜的事：「是不是……？」放在動詞前面或句尾。","「是不是」用来确认自己猜的事：「是不是……？」放在动词前面或句尾。","是不是 sirve para confirmar algo que se supone: «¿verdad que…?». Va antes del verbo o al final de la oración.","是不是 is used to confirm something you assume: 'is it true that …?'. It goes before the verb or at the end."],"1-13-6":["Igual que: 跟…一樣","Comparison with 跟 gēn…一樣 yíyàng","Comparison with 跟 gēn…一样 yíyàng","「A 跟 B 一樣（＋形容詞）」表示 A 和 B 一樣。","「A 跟 B 一样（＋形容词）」表示 A 和 B 一样。","A 跟 B 一樣 (+ adjetivo) = A es igual que B.","A 跟 B 一樣 (+ adjective) means A is the same as B."],"1-14-0":["Duración tras 了","Time-Duration after Verbal 了 le","","「動詞＋了＋時間長度（＋的＋受詞）」表示已經做完的動作持續了多久。","「动词＋了＋时间长度（＋的＋受词）」表示已经做完的动作持续了多久。","Verbo + 了 + duración (+ 的 + objeto) = cuánto tiempo duró una acción ya terminada.","Verb + 了 + duration (+ 的 + object) tells how long a finished action lasted."],"1-14-1":["Doble 了: hasta ahora","Completion-to-date with Double 了 le","","「動詞＋了＋數量＋了」表示到現在為止做了這麼久、這麼多，而且還在繼續。","「动词＋了＋数量＋了」表示到现在为止做了这么久、这么多，而且还在继续。","Verbo + 了 + cantidad + 了 = la acción lleva esa cantidad hasta ahora y todavía continúa.","Verb + 了 + quantity + 了 means 'up to now' the action has lasted/amounted to that much, and it is still going on."],"1-14-2":["Casi: 快…了","快 kuài…了 le about to","","「快＋動詞／形容詞／時間＋了」表示快要、差不多了。","「快＋动词／形容词／时间＋了」表示快要、差不多了。","快 + verbo / adjetivo / hora + 了 = a punto de, ya casi.","快 + verb/adjective/time + 了 means 'about to', 'almost'."],"1-14-3":["Aún más: 更","Comparison 更 gèng even more so","","「更＋形容詞」是「更加……」，是跟前面提過的事物比較。","「更＋形容词」是「更加……」，是跟前面提过的事物比较。","更 + adjetivo = todavía más. Se compara con algo ya mencionado.","更 + adjective means 'even more …'. It compares with something already mentioned."],"1-14-4":["No tan…: 沒有","Inferior Comparison 沒有 méiyǒu…","Inferior Comparison 没有 méiyǒu…","「A 沒有 B（那麼）＋形容詞」表示 A 不如 B。","「A 没有 B（那么）＋形容词」表示 A 不如 B。","A 沒有 B (那麼) + adjetivo = A no es tan… como B.","A 沒有 B (那麼) + adjective means A is not as … as B."],"1-15-0":["Postura libre: lo que sea","Non-committal Stance with Question Words","","用疑問詞可以表示「你想……就……」，是沒有特別限制的說法：什麼……就……。","用疑问词可以表示「你想……就……」，是没有特别限制的说法：什么……就……。","Con pronombres interrogativos se expresa «lo que quieras»: 什麼…就 + verbo. Es una postura sin compromiso.","Question words can express 'whatever you like': 什麼…就…. It signals no particular restriction."],"1-15-1":["Disponer con 把","To Dispose of Something with 把 bǎ","","「把＋受詞（已知的）＋動詞＋補充說明」表示處理某個東西、對它做什麼。動詞後面不能單獨出現。","「把＋受词（已知的）＋动词＋补充说明」表示处理某个东西、对它做什么。动词后面不能单独出现。","把 + objeto (ya conocido) + verbo + complemento: se «dispone» del objeto y se dice qué se hace con él. El verbo no puede ir solo.","把 + object (already known) + verb + complement means 'dealing with' the object, saying what is done to it. The verb can't stand alone."],"1-15-2":["Apenas hice… : V了…就…","V 了 le…就 jiù… do…right after doing…","","「V 了 A 就 B」表示做完 A 以後，馬上做 B。","「V 了 A 就 B」表示做完 A 以后，马上做 B。","V 了 A 就 B = en cuanto terminé A, hago B.","V 了 A 就 B means 'right after finishing A, do B'."],"1-15-3":["Un poco: 一點","一點 yìdiǎn a bit","一点 yìdiǎn a bit","「形容詞＋一點」是「更……一些」，讓請求更客氣。「動詞＋一點」是「做多一些」。","「形容词＋一点」是「更……一些」，让请求更客气。「动词＋一点」是「做多一些」。","Adjetivo + 一點 = un poco más (suaviza una petición). Verbo + 一點 = un poco de.","Adjective + 一點 means 'a bit more …' and softens a request. Verb + 一點 means 'a little more'."],"1-15-4":["Comparar acciones con 得","Comparing Actions with a 得 de Complement","","比較動作時：「A＋動詞＋得＋比 B＋形容詞」，或「A 比 B＋動詞＋得＋形容詞」。","比较动作时：「A＋动词＋得＋比 B＋形容词」，或「A 比 B＋动词＋得＋形容词」。","Para comparar acciones con 得: A + verbo + 得 + 比 B + adjetivo, o A 比 B + verbo + 得 + adjetivo.","To compare actions with 得: A + verb + 得 + 比 B + adjective, or A 比 B + verb + 得 + adjective."],"1-15-5":["Grado en comparaciones","Complements of Degree in Comparison Structures","","用「得」比較時，可以再加差別：「一點」（差一些）或「多了／得多」（差很多）。","用「得」比较时，可以再加差别：「一点」（差一些）或「多了／得多」（差很多）。","En la comparación con complemento de grado se puede añadir la diferencia: 一點 (un poco) o 多了 / 得多 (mucho más).","In comparisons with 得 you can add the size of the difference: 一點 (a little) or 多了 / 得多 (much more)."],"1-15-6":["Verbos separables","Separable Verbs","","離合詞（吃飯、睡覺、游泳、見面）是「動詞＋受詞」，中間可以放別的詞，時間長度或數量放在中間。後面不能再接受詞。","离合词（吃饭、睡觉、游泳、见面）是「动词＋受词」，中间可以放别的词，时间长度或数量放在中间。后面不能再接受词。","Los verbos separables (吃飯, 睡覺, 游泳, 見面) son verbo + objeto: se pueden separar y la duración o cantidad va en medio. No llevan otro objeto directo.","Separable verbs (吃飯, 睡覺, 游泳, 見面) are verb + object; other words can go in between, such as a duration or quantity. They cannot take another object."],"2-1-0":["Desde… hacia con 從…往","從 cóng…往 wǎng… go…from…","从 cóng…往 wǎng… go…from…","「從＋地點＋往＋方向＋動詞」表示從哪裡往哪個方向去，常用來指路。","「从＋地点＋往＋方向＋动词」表示从哪里往哪个方向去，常用来指路。","從 + lugar + 往 + dirección + verbo: desde… hacia… (se usa mucho para dar indicaciones).","從 + place + 往 + direction + verb means 'from… toward…'. It is often used to give directions."],"2-1-1":["Juicio con V起來","Judgmental V-起來 qǐlái It’s my assessment that…","Judgmental V-起来 qǐlái It’s my assessment that…","「V＋起來」表示說話的人根據看到、聽到、吃到的感覺所做的判斷：從……來看。","「V＋起来」表示说话的人根据看到、听到、吃到的感觉所做的判断：从……来看。","V + 起來 expresa una evaluación subjetiva: «a juzgar por cómo se ve / se oye / sabe / se siente».","V + 起來 expresses a subjective judgment: 'judging by how it looks / sounds / tastes / feels'."],"2-1-2":["Estado continuo con 著","Ongoing Action with -著 zhe","Ongoing Action with -着 zhe","「V＋著」表示動作的結果或狀態一直持續著。否定時用「沒＋V＋著」。","「V＋着」表示动作的结果或状态一直持续着。否定时用「没＋V＋着」。","V + 著 indica un estado que continúa (resultado de una acción que permanece). Negación: 沒 + V + 著.","V + 著 shows a state that continues (the result of an action that stays). Negation: 沒 + V + 著."],"2-1-3":["Dos acciones con 一邊…一邊","Two Simultaneously Actions with 一邊 yìbiān…一邊 yìbiān…","Two Simultaneously Actions with 一边 yìbiān…一边 yìbiān…","「一邊 A 一邊 B」表示同一個人同時做 A 和 B 兩件事。","「一边 A 一边 B」表示同一个人同时做 A 和 B 两件事。","一邊 A 一邊 B = hacer A y B al mismo tiempo (el mismo sujeto).","一邊 A 一邊 B means doing A and B at the same time (same subject)."],"2-1-4":["Distancia con 離","Distance from with 離 lí…","Distance from with 离 lí…","「A 離 B ＋（很）遠／近」表示 A 和 B 之間的距離。「離」說的是距離，「從」說的是起點。","「A 离 B ＋（很）远／近」表示 A 和 B 之间的距离。「离」说的是距离，「从」说的是起点。","A 離 B + (很) 遠 / 近 = A está lejos / cerca de B. 離 indica distancia; 從 indica punto de partida.","A 離 B + (很) 遠 / 近 means A is far from / near B. 離 shows distance; 從 shows a starting point."],"2-2-0":["Negación enfática 一點也不","Emphatic Negation with 一點也不 yìdiǎn yě bù V …","Emphatic Negation with 一点也不 yìdiǎn yě bù V …","「一點也不／一點也沒＋動詞或形容詞」是加強語氣的否定，意思是完全不、一點都不。","「一点也不／一点也没＋动词或形容词」是加强语气的否定，意思是完全不、一点都不。","一點也不 / 一點也沒 + verbo o adjetivo = en absoluto, nada. Es una negación enfática.","一點也不 / 一點也沒 + verb or adjective is an emphatic negation: 'not at all'."],"2-2-1":["Sugerencia con 還是…吧","還是 háishì…吧 ba！ It would be better if …","还是 háishì…吧 ba！ It would be better if …","「還是＋建議＋吧」表示比較過後，覺得這樣做比較好。","「还是＋建议＋吧」表示比较过后，觉得这样做比较好。","還是 + sugerencia + 吧 = mejor + (hagamos algo). Se compara y se recomienda una opción.","還是 + suggestion + 吧 means 'it would be better to…' after comparing options."],"2-2-2":["Petición con 一點","Form Adverbials with 一點 yìdiǎn","Form Adverbials with 一点 yìdiǎn","「形容詞＋一點＋動詞」或「動詞＋形容詞＋一點」用來客氣地請對方再怎麼樣一點，語氣比較柔和。","「形容词＋一点＋动词」或「动词＋形容词＋一点」用来客气地请对方再怎么样一点，语气比较柔和。","Adjetivo + 一點 + verbo (o verbo + adjetivo + 一點) forma una petición suave: «hazlo un poco más…».","Adjective + 一點 + verb (or verb + adjective + 一點) makes a soft request: 'a little more…'."],"2-2-3":["Reduplicación AABB","Reduplication of Disyllabic Adjectives","","雙音節形容詞 AB 可以重疊成 AABB，讓描述更生動，前面不用再加「很」。","双音节形容词 AB 可以重叠成 AABB，让描述更生动，前面不用再加「很」。","Los adjetivos de dos sílabas AB se duplican como AABB; resultan más vívidos y ya no llevan 很.","A two-syllable adjective AB can be doubled as AABB to be more vivid. 很 is no longer needed."],"2-2-4":["Negación suave con 不太","不太 bútài not very","","「不太＋形容詞／動詞」表示不是很、不怎麼，語氣比「不」柔和。","「不太＋形容词／动词」表示不是很、不怎么，语气比「不」柔和。","不太 + adjetivo / verbo = no muy, no demasiado. Es una negación suave.","不太 + adjective / verb means 'not very, not so much'. It is a softer negation."],"2-2-5":["Ubicación con 部 y 邊","Locations with 部 bù /邊 biān","Locations with 部 bù /边 biān","「部」用在地區，例如北部、南部、東部；「邊」用在位置，例如上邊、旁邊、左邊、右邊。","「部」用在地区，例如北部、南部、东部；「边」用在位置，例如上边、旁边、左边、右边。","部 se usa para regiones (北部, 南部, 東部, 西部); 邊 para posiciones (上邊, 裡邊, 旁邊, 左邊, 右邊).","部 is used for regions (北部, 南部, 東部, 西部); 邊 for positions (上邊, 裡邊, 旁邊, 左邊, 右邊)."],"2-3-0":["Usos de 差不多","Various Functions of 差不 chàbùduō","","「差不多」可以當形容詞（幾乎一樣）、副詞（快要）或表示大概。","「差不多」可以当形容词（几乎一样）、副词（快要）或表示大概。","差不多 puede ser adjetivo («casi igual»), adverbio («casi») o «más o menos».","差不多 can be an adjective ('almost the same'), an adverb ('almost') or mean 'more or less'."],"2-3-1":["Experiencia con 過","Experience Particle 過 guò","Experience Particle 过 guò","「V＋過」表示有過這樣的經驗。否定時用「沒＋V＋過」。","「V＋过」表示有过这样的经验。否定时用「没＋V＋过」。","V + 過 indica experiencia: «alguna vez». Negación: 沒 + V + 過.","V + 過 shows past experience: 'have ever done'. Negation: 沒 + V + 過."],"2-3-2":["Apenas con 才","才 cái merely, only","","「才＋數量少」表示只有、才剛剛。","「才＋数量少」表示只有、才刚刚。","才 + cantidad pequeña = apenas, solo.","才 + a small amount means 'only, just'."],"2-3-3":["Recordar con 想起來","想起來 xiǎngqǐlái to have remembered","想起来 xiǎngqǐlái to have remembered","「想起來」表示突然想到、記起原本忘記的事。","「想起来」表示突然想到、记起原本忘记的事。","想起來 = recordar de repente algo que se había olvidado.","想起來 means to suddenly remember something that had been forgotten."],"2-3-4":["Más tarde de lo esperado con 才","Longer/Later Than Expected with 才 cái","","「時間＋才＋動詞」表示比預期的晚。跟「就」相反，「就」表示比預期的早。","「时间＋才＋动词」表示比预期的晚。跟「就」相反，「就」表示比预期的早。","Tiempo + 才 + verbo = más tarde de lo esperado. Contrasta con 就 (más temprano de lo esperado).","Time + 才 + verb shows something happens later than expected. It is the opposite of 就 (earlier than expected)."],"2-3-5":["Acción suave con ABAB","Tentative Action with Reduplicated Disyllabic Verbs ABAB","","雙音節動詞 AB 可以重疊成 ABAB，讓動作比較輕鬆，意思是稍微做一下、試試看。","双音节动词 AB 可以重叠成 ABAB，让动作比较轻松，意思是稍微做一下、试试看。","Los verbos de dos sílabas AB duplicados como ABAB suavizan la acción: «un poco, para ver».","A two-syllable verb AB can be doubled as ABAB to soften the action: 'do it a little'."],"2-4-0":["Además de con 除了…還","除了 chúle…，還 hái… in addition to…","除了 chúle…，还 hái… in addition to…","「除了 A，還 B」表示 A 之外，也有 B。","「除了 A，还 B」表示 A 之外，也有 B。","除了 A，還 B = además de A, también B.","除了 A，還 B means 'in addition to A, also B'."],"2-4-1":["Según con 按照","按照…ànzhào… in accordance with","","「按照＋規定／計畫／說法」表示依照某個標準去做。","「按照＋规定／计划／说法」表示依照某个标准去做。","按照 + norma / plan / indicación = según, conforme a.","按照 + rule / plan / instruction means 'according to, in accordance with'."],"2-4-2":["Usos de 跟","Various Meaning of the Preposition 跟 gēn","","「跟」有很多用法：跟誰一起（陪伴）、跟誰學／借（對象）、跟……一樣（比較），也可以像「和」連接兩個名詞。","「跟」有很多用法：跟谁一起（陪伴）、跟谁学／借（对象）、跟……一样（比较），也可以像「和」连接两个名词。","跟 tiene varios usos: «con» (compañía), «de» en 跟…學 / 跟…借, «igual que» en 跟…一樣, y «y» entre sustantivos.","跟 has several uses: 'with' (company), 'from' in 跟…學 / 跟…借, 'the same as' in 跟…一樣, and 'and' between nouns."],"2-4-3":["Usos de 給","Various Meanings of 給 gěi","Various Meanings of 给 gěi","「給」可以是動詞（給我一本書）、介詞（給你的禮物），也可以放在動詞後面表示給誰，例如「寄給他」。","「给」可以是动词（给我一本书）、介词（给你的礼物），也可以放在动词后面表示给谁，例如「寄给他」。","給 puede ser verbo («dar»), preposición («para») o marcar al destinatario después del verbo (寄給你).","給 can be a verb ('give'), a preposition ('for') or follow a verb to mark the receiver (寄給你)."],"2-4-4":["Hacia con 對","對 duì… towards…","对 duì… towards…","「對＋人／事＋形容詞或動詞」表示針對某個對象，常見的有「對……有興趣」「對……很好」。","「对＋人／事＋形容词或动词」表示针对某个对象，常见的有「对……有兴趣」「对……很好」。","對 + persona / cosa + adjetivo o verbo = hacia, con respecto a. Es común en 對…有興趣 y 對…很好.","對 + person / thing + adjective or verb means 'toward, regarding'. Common in 對…有興趣 and 對…很好."],"2-5-0":["Todavía con 還","還 hái still","还 hái still","「還」表示情況持續，意思是仍然、還在。「還沒＋動詞」表示到現在還沒有。","「还」表示情况持续，意思是仍然、还在。「还没＋动词」表示到现在还没有。","還 = todavía, aún (continúa una situación). 還沒 + verbo = todavía no.","還 means 'still' (the situation continues). 還沒 + verb means 'not yet'."],"2-5-1":["Manera con V著","Manner of an Action with V 著 zhe","Manner of an Action with V 着 zhe","「V1＋著＋V2」中，V1 說明做 V2 時的方式或狀態。","「V1＋着＋V2」中，V1 说明做 V2 时的方式或状态。","V1 + 著 + V2: V1 describe la manera en que se realiza V2.","In V1 + 著 + V2, V1 describes the manner in which V2 is done."],"2-5-2":["Varios verbos en una oración","Multiple Verb Phrases in a Sentence","","一個句子裡可以依照動作發生的順序，連續放好幾個動詞。","一个句子里可以依照动作发生的顺序，连续放好几个动词。","En una oración se pueden encadenar varios verbos en el orden en que ocurren.","A sentence can chain several verbs in the order the actions happen."],"2-5-3":["Cuando… entonces con 等…就","When A Comes, Then B…with 等 děng 就…jiù…","","「等 A 就 B」表示等 A 發生之後，就做 B。","「等 A 就 B」表示等 A 发生之后，就做 B。","等 A 就 B = cuando ocurra A, entonces B.","等 A 就 B means 'when A happens, then B'."],"2-5-4":["De pronto con V著V著就…了","While Doing A, B Happens with V 著 zhe V 著 zhe， 就 jiù…了 le","While Doing A, B Happens with V 着 zhe V 着 zhe， 就 jiù…了 le","「V著V著就…了」表示做著做著，突然出現了另一個情況。","「V着V着就…了」表示做着做着，突然出现了另一个情况。","V著V著就…了 = mientras hacía algo, de pronto ocurrió otra cosa.","V著V著就…了 means 'while doing something, suddenly something else happened'."],"2-6-0":["Destino con 到","Destination Marker 到 dào","","「V＋到＋地點」表示動作到達某個地方，「到」標示終點。","「V＋到＋地点」表示动作到达某个地方，「到」标示终点。","V + 到 + lugar: la acción llega hasta ese lugar. 到 marca el destino.","V + 到 + place means the action reaches that place. 到 marks the destination."],"2-6-1":["Dar a alguien con 給","Indirect Object Marker 給 gěi","Indirect Object Marker 给 gěi","「V＋給＋人」表示把東西送、寄、交給某個人，例如送給、寄給、交給、借給。","「V＋给＋人」表示把东西送、寄、交给某个人，例如送给、寄给、交给、借给。","V + 給 + persona: dar o transferir algo a alguien (送給, 寄給, 交給, 借給).","V + 給 + person means giving or passing something to someone (送給, 寄給, 交給, 借給)."],"2-6-2":["Lugar resultante con V在","Resultant Location with V+在 zài…","","「V＋在＋地點」表示動作之後，東西或人留在那個地方。","「V＋在＋地点」表示动作之后，东西或人留在那个地方。","V + 在 + lugar: como resultado de la acción, algo o alguien queda en ese lugar.","V + 在 + place means that, as a result of the action, something or someone ends up in that place."],"2-6-3":["Mover con 把","Moving an Object to a Location with 把 bǎ","","「把＋東西＋動詞＋到／在／給＋地點或人」表示把東西移到某個地方。","「把＋东西＋动词＋到／在／给＋地点或人」表示把东西移到某个地方。","把 + objeto + V + 到 / 在 / 給 + lugar o persona: mover un objeto a otro lugar.","把 + object + V + 到 / 在 / 給 + place or person means moving an object somewhere."],"2-6-4":["Además con 而且","而且 érqiě furthermore","","「而且」表示再加上另一個更進一步的情況。","「而且」表示再加上另一个更进一步的情况。","而且 = además. Añade información que refuerza lo anterior.","而且 means 'furthermore'. It adds information that reinforces the previous point."],"2-7-0":["Dirección con 來／去","Directional ConstructionsV1V2 and V1V2V3","","動詞後面加上、下、進、出、回、過、起，再加「來」或「去」，表示動作的方向：朝說話的人是「來」，離開說話的人是「去」。","动词后面加上、下、进、出、回、过、起，再加「来」或「去」，表示动作的方向：朝说话的人是「来」，离开说话的人是「去」。","Verbo + dirección (上, 下, 進, 出, 回, 過, 起) + 來 / 去: movimiento hacia (來) o lejos (去) del hablante. También V1V2V3.","A verb plus a direction (上, 下, 進, 出, 回, 過, 起) plus 來 or 去 shows movement toward (來) or away from (去) the speaker. V1V2V3 also exists."],"2-7-1":["把 con dirección","把 bǎ with V1V2V3","","「把＋東西＋動詞＋方向＋來／去」表示把東西往某個方向移動。","「把＋东西＋动词＋方向＋来／去」表示把东西往某个方向移动。","把 + objeto + verbo + dirección + 來 / 去: mover el objeto en esa dirección.","把 + object + verb + direction + 來 / 去 means moving the object in that direction."],"2-7-2":["Reproche con 嗎","Confrontation with 嗎?","Confrontation with 吗?","用「嗎」的問句有時不是真的在問，而是在責備或表示不滿：你沒看到……嗎？","用「吗」的问句有时不是真的在问，而是在责备或表示不满：你没看到……吗？","Una pregunta con 嗎 puede expresar reproche o confrontación: «¿no ves que…?».","A question with 嗎 can express reproach or confrontation rather than a real question: 'Can't you see…?'"],"2-7-3":["Posición con V著","Existential Sentence with Posture Verbs","","「地點＋姿勢動詞（坐、站、躺、放、掛、貼）＋著＋人或東西」表示那裡擺放或存在的狀態。","「地点＋姿势动词（坐、站、躺、放、挂、贴）＋着＋人或东西」表示那里摆放或存在的状态。","Lugar + verbo de posición (坐, 站, 躺, 放, 掛, 貼) + 著 + persona o cosa: así está colocado.","Place + posture verb (坐, 站, 躺, 放, 掛, 貼) + 著 + person or thing describes how something is placed there."],"2-7-4":["Para con 為了","為了 wèile in order to","为了 wèile in order to","「為了＋目的，＋動作」表示做某件事的目的。","「为了＋目的，＋动作」表示做某件事的目的。","為了 + objetivo, + acción = para, con el fin de.","為了 + goal, + action means 'in order to'."],"2-8-0":["Percepción con 見","見 jiàn as a Perceptual Result","见 jiàn as a Perceptual Result","「V＋見」表示感官的結果，例如看見、聽見，真的看到或聽到了。","「V＋见」表示感官的结果，例如看见、听见，真的看到或听到了。","V + 見 expresa que la percepción se logró: 看見 (ver), 聽見 (oír).","V + 見 shows a successful perception: 看見 (see), 聽見 (hear)."],"2-8-1":["Comprender con 懂","懂 dǒng as a Cognitive Result","","「V＋懂」表示聽或看之後理解了，例如聽懂、看懂。","「V＋懂」表示听或看之后理解了，例如听懂、看懂。","V + 懂 = comprender lo que se escucha o lee: 聽懂, 看懂.","V + 懂 means understanding what you hear or read: 聽懂, 看懂."],"2-8-2":["Aprender con 會","會 huìas an Achievement Result","会 huìas an Achievement Result","「V＋會」表示學習之後學會了，例如學會、教會。","「V＋会」表示学习之后学会了，例如学会、教会。","V + 會 = aprender a hacer algo (logro): 學會, 教會.","V + 會 means to have learned how to do something: 學會, 教會."],"2-8-3":["Potencial con 得／不","Potential Capability with -得 de- or -不 bù-","","「V＋得＋補語」表示可以，「V＋不＋補語」表示不能，指在條件上做不做得到。","「V＋得＋补语」表示可以，「V＋不＋补语」表示不能，指在条件上做不做得到。","V + 得 + complemento = se puede; V + 不 + complemento = no se puede (por las circunstancias).","V + 得 + complement means can; V + 不 + complement means cannot, depending on the circumstances."],"2-8-4":["Capacidad con 了 (liǎo)","Capability Complement 了 liǎo","","「V＋得了／不了」表示能不能完成或承受。這裡的「了」唸 liǎo。","「V＋得了／不了」表示能不能完成或承受。这里的「了」念 liǎo。","V + 得了 / 不了 = poder / no poder completar o soportar algo. Aquí 了 se lee liǎo.","V + 得了 / 不了 means being able / unable to finish or endure something. Here 了 is read liǎo."],"2-8-5":["Resultado con 得","Vs +得 de + complement so …that…","","「形容詞或動詞＋得＋結果」表示程度很高，高到出現某個結果：……得……。","「形容词或动词＋得＋结果」表示程度很高，高到出现某个结果：……得……。","Adjetivo / verbo + 得 + resultado = tan… que…","Adjective / verb + 得 + result means 'so… that…'."],"2-8-6":["Continuar con 下去","To Keep on Doing Something with 下去 xiàqù","","「V＋下去」表示從現在開始繼續做下去。","「V＋下去」表示从现在开始继续做下去。","V + 下去 = seguir haciendo algo (de ahora en adelante).","V + 下去 means to keep on doing something from now on."],"2-8-7":["Terminar con 完","Completion of an Action with V+完 wán","","「V＋完」表示把某件事做完。否定時用「沒＋V＋完」。","「V＋完」表示把某件事做完。否定时用「没＋V＋完」。","V + 完 = terminar de hacer algo. Negación: 沒 + V + 完.","V + 完 means to finish doing something. Negation: 沒 + V + 完."],"2-9-0":["Listo con 好","All Set and Ready with Verb Complement 好 hǎo","","「V＋好」表示事情做好了、準備好了，例如準備好、做好、洗好。","「V＋好」表示事情做好了、准备好了，例如准备好、做好、洗好。","V + 好 = quedar listo o hecho bien: 準備好, 做好, 洗好.","V + 好 means something is done or ready: 準備好, 做好, 洗好."],"2-9-1":["Lograr con 到","To Be Successful in …with Verb Complement 到 dào","","「V＋到」表示達到想要的結果，例如買到、找到、看到。","「V＋到」表示达到想要的结果，例如买到、找到、看到。","V + 到 = lograr el resultado esperado: 買到, 找到, 看到.","V + 到 means achieving the intended result: 買到, 找到, 看到."],"2-9-2":["Comparar con 比起來","Comparison with 比起來 bǐ qǐlái","Comparison with 比起来 bǐ qǐlái","「跟 B 比起來，A……」或「比起 B，A……」表示拿 A 跟 B 做比較。","「跟 B 比起来，A……」或「比起 B，A……」表示拿 A 跟 B 做比较。","跟 B 比起來，A… / 比起 B，A… = en comparación con B, A…","跟 B 比起來，A… / 比起 B，A… means 'compared with B, A…'."],"2-9-3":["Semejanza con 像…一樣","像 xiàng…一樣 yí yàng … is just like…","像 xiàng…一样 yí yàng … is just like…","「A 像 B 一樣（＋形容詞／動詞）」表示 A 跟 B 很相似。","「A 像 B 一样（＋形容词／动词）」表示 A 跟 B 很相似。","A 像 B 一樣 (+ adjetivo / verbo) = A es como B.","A 像 B 一樣 (+ adjective / verb) means A is like B."],"2-9-4":["Extremo con 極了","Adverbial Complements 極了 jíle、得不得了 de bùdéliǎo、得很 de hěn terribly, extremely","Adverbial Complements 极了 jíle、得不得了 de bùdéliǎo、得很 de hěn terribly, extremely","「形容詞＋極了／得不得了／得很」放在形容詞後面，表示非常、程度很高。","「形容词＋极了／得不得了／得很」放在形容词后面，表示非常、程度很高。","Adjetivo + 極了 / 得不得了 / 得很 = extremadamente. Van después del adjetivo.","Adjective + 極了 / 得不得了 / 得很 goes after the adjective and means 'extremely'."],"2-9-5":["Poder permitirse con 起","Verb Complement 起 qǐ to be able to afford","","「V＋得起／不起」表示有沒有能力負擔，通常指錢夠不夠。","「V＋得起／不起」表示有没有能力负担，通常指钱够不够。","V + 得起 / 不起 = poder / no poder permitirse algo (por dinero o categoría).","V + 得起 / 不起 means being able / unable to afford something (usually money)."],"2-10-0":["Descubrir con 出來","To Figure out with the Complement 出來 chūlái","To Figure out with the Complement 出来 chūlái","「V＋出來」表示把原本不清楚的事情找出來、分辨出來或想出來。","「V＋出来」表示把原本不清楚的事情找出来、分辨出来或想出来。","V + 出來 = descubrir, distinguir o llegar a darse cuenta (sacar a la luz).","V + 出來 means to figure out, make out or discover something."],"2-10-1":["Caber con 下","Enough Space to Accommodate with Verb Complement 下 xià","","「V＋得下／不下」表示空間夠不夠容納。","「V＋得下／不下」表示空间够不够容纳。","V + 得下 / 不下 = hay / no hay espacio suficiente para acomodar algo.","V + 得下 / 不下 means whether there is enough space to hold something."],"2-10-2":["把…V(一)V","Disposal Construction 把 bǎ with Verb Reduplication 把 bǎ…V(一)V","","「把＋東西＋V(一)V」表示稍微處理一下那個東西，語氣輕鬆。","「把＋东西＋V(一)V」表示稍微处理一下那个东西，语气轻松。","把 + objeto + V(一)V = hacer algo con el objeto de forma breve o ligera.","把 + object + V(一)V means to do something to the object briefly or lightly."],"2-10-3":["把 con resultado","Disposal Construction 把 bǎ with Resultative Complements","","「把＋東西＋動詞＋結果補語（完、好、乾淨、壞……）」表示東西因為這個動作變成某種結果。","「把＋东西＋动词＋结果补语（完、好、干净、坏……）」表示东西因为这个动作变成某种结果。","把 + objeto + V + complemento de resultado (完, 好, 乾淨, 壞…): el objeto queda en ese estado.","把 + object + verb + result complement (完, 好, 乾淨, 壞…) shows the state the object ends up in."],"2-10-4":["Aprovechar con 趁","趁 chèn seize the moment","","「趁＋機會＋動詞」表示利用某個機會或時間去做事。","「趁＋机会＋动词」表示利用某个机会或时间去做事。","趁 + oportunidad + verbo = aprovechar el momento para…","趁 + opportunity + verb means 'take advantage of the moment to…'."],"2-11-0":["其他的 vs 別的","The Others 其他 qítā de vs. Other 別的 biéde vs.","The Others 其他 qítā de vs. Other 别的 biéde vs.","「其他的」是一群裡面剩下的人或東西；「別的」是另外不同的東西或選擇。","「其他的」是一群里面剩下的人或东西；「别的」是另外不同的东西或选择。","其他的 = los demás (el resto de un grupo). 別的 = otro, diferente (otra cosa u opción).","其他的 means 'the rest' of a group; 別的 means 'another / something different'."],"2-11-1":["Clasificadores verbales","Verbal Classifiers 下 xià , 趟 tàng ,遍 biàn , and 次 cì","","動量詞用來算動作的次數：「次」是回數；「遍」是從頭到尾一次；「趟」是去一次再回來；「下」是很短的動作。","动量词用来算动作的次数：「次」是回数；「遍」是从头到尾一次；「趟」是去一次再回来；「下」是很短的动作。","Clasificadores verbales: 次 = veces; 遍 = de principio a fin; 趟 = viaje de ida y vuelta; 下 = acción breve.","Verbal measure words count actions: 次 = times; 遍 = once from start to finish; 趟 = a round trip; 下 = a short action."],"2-11-2":["然後、後來、以後","Expressing Next in Sequence with 然後 ránhòu, 後來 hòulái, and 以後 yǐhòu","Expressing Next in Sequence with 然后 ránhòu, 后来 hòulái, and 以后 yǐhòu","「然後」表示接著；「後來」只能說過去的事；「以後」可以說過去或未來。","「然后」表示接着；「后来」只能说过去的事；「以后」可以说过去或未来。","然後 = luego (secuencia); 後來 = más tarde (solo para el pasado); 以後 = después (pasado o futuro).","然後 means 'and then' (sequence); 後來 means 'later' (only for the past); 以後 means 'after' (past or future)."],"2-11-3":["Solo entonces con 才","才 cái then and only then","","「A 才 B」表示要先有 A，才會有 B，A 是前提。","「A 才 B」表示要先有 A，才会有 B，A 是前提。","A 才 B = solo después de A ocurre B (A es condición previa).","A 才 B means B happens only after A. A is a prerequisite."],"2-11-4":["Pasiva con 被","Passive Sentences with 被 bèi","","「A 被 B ＋動詞＋補語」表示 A 受到 B 的影響，常常是不好的事。","「A 被 B ＋动词＋补语」表示 A 受到 B 的影响，常常是不好的事。","A 被 B + verbo + complemento = A es afectado por B (pasiva, suele tener sentido negativo).","A 被 B + verb + complement means A is affected by B (passive). It often describes something unfortunate."],"2-11-5":["V了V","Verb Reduplication in V 了 le V","","「V了V」表示做了一下子，是已經做過的動作。","「V了V」表示做了一下子，是已经做过的动作。","V 了 V = hacer algo un ratito o un poco (acción ya realizada).","V了V means doing something for a little while (an action already carried out)."],"2-11-6":["Contacto con 上","Verb Particle 上 shàng coming into contact","","「V＋上」表示接觸或閉合，例如關上、穿上、考上、愛上。","「V＋上」表示接触或闭合，例如关上、穿上、考上、爱上。","V + 上 expresa contacto o cierre: 關上 (cerrar), 穿上 (ponerse), 考上 (ser admitido), 愛上 (enamorarse).","V + 上 shows contact or closing: 關上 (close), 穿上 (put on), 考上 (get admitted), 愛上 (fall in love with)."],"2-12-0":["Dejar con 讓","讓 ràng to let someone do something","让 ràng to let someone do something","「A 讓 B ＋動詞」表示 A 允許或使 B 去做某件事。","「A 让 B ＋动词」表示 A 允许或使 B 去做某件事。","A 讓 B + verbo = A deja / hace que B haga algo (permiso o causa).","A 讓 B + verb means A lets / makes B do something (permission or cause)."],"2-12-1":["Apúrate con 快一點","快一點 kuài yìdiǎn hurry up","快一点 kuài yìdiǎn hurry up","「快一點」是催促的說法，語氣比較柔和，意思是動作快一點。","「快一点」是催促的说法，语气比较柔和，意思是动作快一点。","快一點 = ¡date prisa! (petición o mandato suave).","快一點 is a gentle urging: 'hurry up'."],"2-12-2":["Mencionar con 起","Verb Particle 起 qǐ to touch upon","","「V＋起」，例如談起、提起、說起，表示開始提到某個話題。","「V＋起」，例如谈起、提起、说起，表示开始提到某个话题。","V + 起 (談起, 提起, 說起, 想起) = empezar a mencionar un tema.","V + 起 (談起, 提起, 說起) means to begin mentioning a topic."],"2-12-3":["Con tal de que 只要…就","只要 zhǐyào……就 jiù… …as long as…","","「只要 A 就 B」表示只需要 A 這個條件，就會有 B。","「只要 A 就 B」表示只需要 A 这个条件，就会有 B。","只要 A 就 B = con tal de que A, B (A es condición suficiente).","只要 A 就 B means 'as long as A, then B' (A is a sufficient condition)."],"2-12-4":["Cuanto más… con 越…越","越 yuè…越 yuè…the more…, the more…","","「越 A 越 B」表示 A 的程度增加，B 也跟著增加。","「越 A 越 B」表示 A 的程度增加，B 也跟着增加。","越 A 越 B = cuanto más A, más B.","越 A 越 B means 'the more A, the more B'."],"2-12-5":["Tema de contraste","Topic as Contrastive","","把一個主題放在句子開頭，用來和另一件事對比：就 A 來說……，可是 B……。","把一个主题放在句子开头，用来和另一件事对比：就 A 来说……，可是 B……。","Un tema al inicio sirve para contrastar con otro: «en cuanto a A…, pero B…».","Putting a topic at the start of the sentence sets up a contrast: 'as for A…, but B…'."],"2-13-0":["Haber terminado con 過","Completion of Action with V+過 guò","Completion of Action with V+过 guò","「V＋過」也可以表示已經做完某件事，多用在問句，例如「吃過飯了嗎？」","「V＋过」也可以表示已经做完某件事，多用在问句，例如「吃过饭了吗？」","V + 過 también indica que ya terminó de hacer algo (acción completada). Se usa sobre todo en preguntas: 吃過飯了嗎？","V + 過 can also mean that an action has already been completed, mostly in questions: 吃過飯了嗎？"],"2-13-1":["Alejarse con 走","Verb Particle 走 zǒu away","","「V＋走」表示離開或被帶走，例如拿走、帶走、開走。","「V＋走」表示离开或被带走，例如拿走、带走、开走。","V + 走 = llevarse, irse (alejarse): 拿走, 帶走, 開走.","V + 走 means taking away or leaving: 拿走, 帶走, 開走."],"2-13-2":["Mandar con 叫","Imperative Sentences with 叫 jiào","","「A 叫 B ＋動詞」表示 A 要求或命令 B 去做某件事。","「A 叫 B ＋动词」表示 A 要求或命令 B 去做某件事。","A 叫 B + verbo = A manda o pide a B que haga algo.","A 叫 B + verb means A tells / asks B to do something."],"2-13-3":["Dejar de con 別再…了","別再 bié zài…了 le stop doing it","别再 bié zài…了 le stop doing it","「別再＋動詞＋了」表示不要再重複做，或叫對方停止。","「别再＋动词＋了」表示不要再重复做，或叫对方停止。","別再 + verbo + 了 = no lo vuelvas a hacer / deja de hacerlo.","別再 + verb + 了 means 'don't do it again / stop doing it'."],"2-13-4":["Seguridad con 會…的","To offer assurance with 會 huì…的 de…","To offer assurance with 会 huì…的 de…","「會……的」表示說話的人很確定未來會發生，有保證、安慰的語氣。","「会……的」表示说话的人很确定未来会发生，有保证、安慰的语气。","會…的 expresa seguridad o promesa sobre el futuro: «seguro que…».","會…的 expresses confidence about the future, with a reassuring tone: 'surely…'."],"2-13-5":["Por medio de 透過","透過 tòuguò… by means of…","透过 tòuguò… by means of…","「透過＋方法或人」表示經由某個管道或人。","「透过＋方法或人」表示经由某个管道或人。","透過 + medio o persona = por medio de, a través de.","透過 + means or person means 'through, by means of'."],"2-13-6":["才…就…","才 cái…就 jiù… only just…, and…already","","「A 才 B 就 C」表示剛剛 A，很快就 B，表示事情發生得很快。","「A 才 B 就 C」表示刚刚 A，很快就 B，表示事情发生得很快。","A 才 B 就 C = apenas A y ya B: algo ocurrió muy pronto.","A 才 B 就 C means 'barely A and already B': something happened very soon."],"2-13-7":["Frecuencia con 每","Frequency with 每 měi + Time Expression","","「每＋時間＋次數」表示在固定的時間裡做幾次。","「每＋时间＋次数」表示在固定的时间里做几次。","每 + tiempo + frecuencia = tantas veces cada…","每 + time + frequency means how many times something happens in each period."],"2-13-8":["Solo si con 只有…才","只有 zhǐyǒu…，才 cái… cannot …, unless…","","「只有 A 才 B」表示 A 是唯一的條件，沒有 A 就不會有 B。","「只有 A 才 B」表示 A 是唯一的条件，没有 A 就不会有 B。","只有 A 才 B = solo si A, B (A es condición necesaria).","只有 A 才 B means 'only if A, then B' (A is a necessary condition)."],"2-14-0":["A punto de con 就要…了","就要 jiù yào…了 le will soon…","","「就要＋動詞＋了」表示馬上就要發生，比「快……了」更近。","「就要＋动词＋了」表示马上就要发生，比「快……了」更近。","就要 + verbo + 了 = estar a punto de. Es más cercano que 快…了.","就要 + verb + 了 means 'about to happen', closer in time than 快…了."],"2-14-1":["Hablando de con 說到","說到 shuōdào/談到 tándào… talking of…","说到 shuōdào/谈到 tándào… talking of…","「說到／談到＋話題」表示說起某個話題的時候。","「说到／谈到＋话题」表示说起某个话题的时候。","說到 / 談到 + tema = hablando de…, cuando se trata de…","說到 / 談到 + topic means 'speaking of…, when it comes to…'."],"2-14-2":["對A有B","對 duìA 有 yǒu B to be B in A","对 duìA 有 yǒu B to be B in A","「對 A 有 B」表示對 A 有某種影響或感覺，例如對……有幫助、有興趣、有信心。","「对 A 有 B」表示对 A 有某种影响或感觉，例如对……有帮助、有兴趣、有信心。","對 A 有 B = hacia A hay B (efecto o sentimiento): 對…有幫助 / 有興趣 / 有信心.","對 A 有 B means B (an effect or feeling) toward A: 對…有幫助 / 有興趣 / 有信心."],"2-14-3":["Incluso con 連…都","連 lián…都 dōu… even","连 lián…都 dōu… even","「連 A 都 B」表示連 A 這麼極端的情況也是 B。","「连 A 都 B」表示连 A 这么极端的情况也是 B。","連 A 都 B = incluso A también B. A es el caso extremo.","連 A 都 B means 'even A is B'. A is the extreme case."],"2-14-4":["No solo con 不但…而且","不但 búdàn…，而且 érqiě… not only…but also…","","「不但 A，而且 B」表示不只 A，還有 B。","「不但 A，而且 B」表示不只 A，还有 B。","不但 A，而且 B = no solo A sino también B.","不但 A，而且 B means 'not only A but also B'."],"2-14-5":["把 sin querer","Unintentional 把 bǎ Construction","","「把＋東西＋動詞＋補語」也可以表示不是故意做的事，例如弄丟、弄壞、忘了。","「把＋东西＋动词＋补语」也可以表示不是故意做的事，例如弄丢、弄坏、忘了。","把 + objeto + verbo + complemento puede expresar algo hecho sin querer (un accidente): 弄丟, 弄壞, 忘.","把 + object + verb + complement can also describe something done unintentionally, such as 弄丟, 弄壞, 忘."],"2-15-0":["Hasta con 到","Post-verbal Preposition 到 dào upto, till","","「V＋到＋時間或地點」表示動作持續到某個時間或地點為止。","「V＋到＋时间或地点」表示动作持续到某个时间或地点为止。","V + 到 + tiempo / lugar = hasta (el límite de una acción).","V + 到 + time / place means 'until / up to' (the limit of the action)."],"2-15-1":["De uno en uno con 一M一M","Manner 一 M 一 M one at a time","","「一＋量詞＋一＋量詞」表示一個接著一個，例如一個一個、一口一口。","「一＋量词＋一＋量词」表示一个接着一个，例如一个一个、一口一口。","一 + clasificador + 一 + clasificador = de uno en uno, poco a poco (manera).","一 + measure word + 一 + measure word means 'one by one' or 'bit by bit'."],"2-15-2":["Cada vez más con 一M比一M","Intensifying a State with 一 M 一 M more and more X; more X than the last…","","「一＋量詞＋比＋一＋量詞＋形容詞」表示越來越……。","「一＋量词＋比＋一＋量词＋形容词」表示越来越……。","一 + clasificador + 比 + 一 + clasificador + adjetivo = cada vez más…","一 + measure word + 比 + 一 + measure word + adjective means 'more and more…'."],"2-15-3":["Empezar con 起來","Inchoative Meaning with 起來 qǐlái","Inchoative Meaning with 起来 qǐlái","「動詞或形容詞＋起來」表示開始出現某個動作或狀態。","「动词或形容词＋起来」表示开始出现某个动作或状态。","V / adjetivo + 起來 = empezar a (inicio de una acción o estado).","Verb / adjective + 起來 means starting an action or a state."],"2-15-4":["Frases de cuatro caracteres","Four-character Phrases 四字格 sìzìgé","","四字格是由四個字組成的固定說法，用來簡短表達一個意思，要當成一個整體來記。","四字格是由四个字组成的固定说法，用来简短表达一个意思，要当成一个整体来记。","Las expresiones de cuatro caracteres (四字格) condensan una idea y se usan como una unidad fija.","Four-character phrases (四字格) are fixed expressions that express an idea concisely. Learn them as a unit."]});
